ed to end-user customers who purchased Xerox and non-Xerox equipment sold through distributors, resellers and dealers. </span></div><div style="height:45pt;position:relative;width:100%"><div style="bottom:0;position:absolute;width:100%"><div style="text-align:right;text-indent:-13.5pt"><span style="color:#da2031;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Xerox 2025 Annual Report      </span><span style="color:#da2031;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">62</span></div></div></div><hr style="page-break-after:always"/><div style="min-height:40.5pt;width:100%"><div style="text-align:right"><span><br/></span></div><div><span style="color:#0000ff;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;text-decoration:underline"><a style="color:#0000ff;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;text-decoration:underline" href="#i34a531d1132e4d49a0105d9aebf883ff_10">Table of Conten</a><a style="color:#0000ff;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;text-decoration:underline" href="#i34a531d1132e4d49a0105d9aebf883ff_10">t</a><a style="color:#0000ff;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;text-decoration:underline" href="#i34a531d1132e4d49a0105d9aebf883ff_10">s</a></span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">                   </span></div><div><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">                                                                                                                                       </span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"> </span></div></div><div style="margin-bottom:6pt;margin-top:6pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#00000